{"id":"atmosphe_re","lemma":"atmosphère","pos":"noun","rank":2764,"glosses":["atmosphere"],"ipa":"/at.mɔs.fɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6f/Fr-atmosph%C3%A8re.ogg/Fr-atmosph%C3%A8re.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"atmosphères"},"formAudio":{"atmosphères":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-atmosph%C3%A8res.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'aime l'atmosphère de ce restaurant.","en":"I like the atmosphere of this restaurant.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/653747","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"restaurant"}]},{"text":"Votre maison dégage une atmosphère agréable.","en":"Your house has a very cozy atmosphere.","words":[{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"to free","l":"dégager"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"pleasurable"}]},{"text":"Cet endroit a une atmosphère mystérieuse.","en":"This place has a mysterious atmosphere.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"place, spot"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"mysterious","l":"mystérieux"}]},{"text":"Tu fous en l'air l'atmosphère.","en":"You're spoiling the mood.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"crazy, mad","l":"fou"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"air"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"L'atmosphère était oppressante.","en":"The atmosphere was oppressive.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]}]}